bqto Pro: saved connections (profiles) and groups of them (stacks).
  bqto connect --project P --service cloudsql --instance orders --save db
      connect, and save the session as the profile db

  bqto profile create cache --project P --service redis --instance cache
      save a profile without connecting

  bqto connect db
      open a profile by name

  bqto stack create work --profile db --profile cache
      group profiles into a stack

  bqto connect --stack work
      open every profile of the stack through one bastion

  bqto profile list | show NAME | rename OLD NEW | rm NAME
      (the same for stack)

These commands need bqto Pro:
join the bqto Pro beta at https://bqto.dev/#waitlist.
